# =====================================================================
# .gitignore for the touchHLE + Song Summoner fork.
#
# Categories below:
#   1. Build outputs (Rust + Android + native)
#   2. Editor / IDE / OS cruft
#   3. Runtime logs and per-user state
#   4. Bundled apps and personal media (copyright + privacy)
#   5. Release artifacts (zips, packed distro folders)
#   6. RE / inspect outputs (unpacked .ipa)
# =====================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Build outputs
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
/target
/vendor/boost
/build
/captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
.gradle
/local.properties
local.properties
android/app/src/main/jniLibs
android/app/build
android/build

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Editor / IDE / OS cruft
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.iml
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.mcp.json

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Runtime logs and per-user state
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs touchHLE writes on every launch -- always regenerable.
run.log
touchHLE_log.txt
DUMP.txt

# Per-user cache that contains absolute paths from the developer's
# machine. (touchHLE_options.txt stays tracked: src/paths.rs embeds it
# as the template for new users, so keep personal edits out of it.)
touchHLE_music_library.txt
touchHLE_music_library_cache.tsv
touchHLE_wallpaper.*

# Sandboxed app data (save games etc). Personal + can be huge.
/touchHLE_sandbox

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Bundled apps and personal media (copyright + privacy)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anything dropped here by the user -- IPAs are almost always
# copyright-encumbered and should not be redistributed via git.
/touchHLE_apps/*
/apps
*.ipa
# But do keep the explainer README that comes with the empty
# touchHLE_apps/ directory.
!/touchHLE_apps/README.txt

# Android wrapper auto-launch IPA asset (same .ipa as above; lives
# inside the flavor's assets so Gradle picks it up). Keep the rest of
# the flavor (drawables, layouts) tracked.
android/app/src/songsummoner/assets/song_summoner.ipa

# Per-user music library a developer adds for testing. The three NCS
# tracks already in sample_music/ ship with the distro (NCS allows
# free redistribution with credit), so they stay tracked -- only
# additional dropped files (which you don't redistribute) are
# excluded by uncommenting the lines below.
# /sample_music/*.mp3
# /sample_music/*.m4a
# /sample_music/*.wav
# /sample_music/*.flac
# /sample_music/*.ogg

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Release artifacts
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Distro folders are populated by the packaging step; ship them via
# GitHub Releases, not git. Keep their README/source if you want to
# track the packaging script -- but the populated copies are bulky and
# get re-generated on every refresh.
/dist
/dist_windows
/dist_wrapper

# Zipped distros at repo root.
SongSummoner_Windows.zip
SongSummoner_Android.zip
*.zip

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. RE / inspect outputs
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unpacked .ipa contents are copyrighted Square Enix material; only the
# RE scripts (.py / .md write-ups) are safe to commit.
/inspect/Payload
/inspect/iTunesArtwork
/inspect/Lning@iphonecake.com
# AI assistant briefs / scratch notes -- not part of the project.
/inspect/PROBLEM_FOR_*.md
